.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472790773862400307856.jpeg/YIZwwXbUgsBHq1sF5AWdYDCLy0ZwDnzPpDK2BaQytgU\"/><figcaption>示意圖（roberto-nickson/Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472785300295680675820.jpeg/D1J_hr6aJaHUBo4ez4_Uk5eElM6b4Dk7KHC2vyhwtr8\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472788249022464054912.jpeg/D0K8VsYPj6mD9n7IvEe8wjJ_y6wgz_guMnbDRzJ2w0c\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472790715404288841507.jpeg/oqSvyvRoIoK9afE64S0dZzVNPk9XZ_v15MXVuuTF1bo\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"示意圖（edceee/Unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626467460677111808815427.jpeg/SFqW5Yfn5lJtQ0MuNXOn_vs0iIfHzrPvsOfUTbDn1E0\"/><figcaption>示意圖（edceee/Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472793882234880170536.jpeg/Wq2EJH_K1FkVGQPwCM34iE8Iag1JhqmbEd-jaRHfo2k\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472796336033792532109.jpeg/_bCDxgHB3ezrgkBMsiDhgKsxJfDlVV-A6PwIrOj8CKw\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472798735306752708691.jpeg/6LzBIG_OGi51fgA6uqPl6bChM0788IpVI-ao7yPmqO8\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"示意圖（artem-beliaikin/Unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472788114542592452981.jpeg/isR01DgrqHDVv13ia59RiACigQ5SXWVz4O4qleDuKpU\"/><figcaption>示意圖（artem-beliaikin/Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472800752898048015649.jpeg/GZ93eQlDzgdDLZ7sM1faFHhqFWqz6bChOhFQUDoRUFA\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472776454115328258397.jpeg/PGBN3k_N4g0gxbiNuudHvSFg0fiOfz_qTRV1pk0VdaY\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"示意圖（julie-kwak/Unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472784712699904475938.jpeg/3v9FTNsvkcwtUJw-o-2Ea3Zlr-peIcIzwTffacE332k\"/><figcaption>示意圖（julie-kwak/Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472778417180672428957.jpeg/l053oNNyfNloPOwm4LIM3ZD1P-LL9SuUe0TTuXtE07k\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472780459937792409623.jpeg/vJZBjdL5_Q-R2sh3B-s8dMVxWq90m3H5b8-M4m_PjOI\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472782783713280241703.jpeg/kyI0YhFI4HBUxmJ2qRA9l1ZLEHRI4W3HIn2aTCJ9mkw\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472784893579264315629.jpeg/JqEmYJWHaTSkrmQ8y2OVD8ld91cIeMF_J3Pimidz4po\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472787364155392120785.jpeg/73rRQ6kcqAl33tPdxCMOgfuGvOZJHzZmXWhlc11oZXM\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472789297860608076319.jpeg/9K7dvVTaVXo3Y8RS81sdRk7S_0uN_OFMRdTVJEXU1SQ\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220720/626472791533555712380547.jpeg/cjoSiZJB-rfM8MDCvPozDb0UUOjchY1UEEcWwhBHFsI\"/><figcaption>夏日10大消暑貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>夏天體味變重…懷疑沒洗乾淨 醫揭「真正原因」身體恐已出問題</p><p>借58萬給陌生單親媽開早餐店！親戚一句話感動律師：看到聖潔光輝</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p><p>本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-07T02:42:41.461104+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1504,"images":42,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}